Code disclosure
---------------
The package includes three Python 3 scripts:

* scripts/ledger.py reads two caller-named Markdown files and reports word
  accounting, text-conservation, and footnote-reference results.
* scripts/docx_redline.py edits OOXML files only inside a caller-named unpacked
  Word-document directory according to a caller-supplied JSON plan.
* scripts/polish_footnotes.py reads a caller-named Word document, uses a local
  temporary directory, and writes or replaces only the caller-named output.

All three scripts use only the Python standard library. They make no network
calls, spawn no subprocesses, perform no dynamic evaluation, and do not handle
credentials or tokens.

